Z||000008||Pheagey||12-03-2001||08:45 AM||||I was ganna pass this up 'cause I don't talk about my 'incident' often anymore but since you asked...<BR>1. What is your most memorable moment?<BR>      Half way through my Sr. year I had moved out of my old mans place and was living with some friends grandparents (nice people they were). Apparently everyone took me living with them as a bad thing. According to 'reliable sources' I was stockpiling weapons, explosives, had a cult following and was , not planning to, was going to..well flatten the school and the people therein. I was removed from school and since they had no hard evidently, just 700 very scared people, they couldn't charge me with any crime. so they gave me an ultimatum...(if you want the rest we can have that interview)<BR>2. Why was it your most memorable moment?<BR>   For someone that just started relying upon themselves then having to deal with this, quit a challenge and life altering.<BR>3. How did it affect the rest of your life?<BR>   Changed everything, including how I view people.<BR>4. If you could change something about this moment, what would it be?<BR>   It may seem mean but I would have used it to my advantage, maybe got into the anti-terrorist task force...<BR>5. What did you learn from that experience, if anything?<BR>   Never underestimate the power of dumb/brown noisers in large groups.<BR>6. Was this moment a major turning point in your life? Why or why not?<BR>   Yes, it was a very major chance in my life. Nothing else (not even relocating across the country) has held a candle to it.<P>Anyway, if you'd like that interview PM me and we can set up a time.<BR>[edited for spelling]<P>------------------<BR>'88 coupe, 5 speed, custom paint job<BR>"I! have a plan!"<BR>Have you seen my website yet? <A HREF="Http://www.LithiumEffects/pheageysfeiro" TARGET=_blank>Http://www.LithiumEffects/pheageysfeiro</A> <BR>Killed: '97 civic CS auto;<BR>Killed by: '94 Civic Ex, '96 Camery LX<BR>Vandalized: 2 time (in 2 days).<p>[This message has been edited by Pheagey (edited 12-03-2001).]||||reg||6
